message: "If you use this software or paper, please cite it using these details."
title: "SRM Speed and Torque Control"
abstract: "We implemented a cascaded speed and torque control system for a three-phase 6/4 switched reluctance motor combining an outer PI speed regulator, a cubic torque sharing function (TSF), nonlinear torque-to-current inversion, hysteresis current control, and an asymmetric half-bridge converter in MATLAB/Simulink, alongside an independent Python forward-Euler reproduction."
